  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你有没有发现：一个网站第一次打开，图片一张张慢慢冒出来；关掉再打开，几乎一下就全出来了。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.166
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:hook-1"
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "start": 253,
  "duration": 252,
  "audioFrames": 242,
  "audioSec": 8.067,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 253,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "网络没变，网站也没变，为什么第二次快这么多？",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 4.088
   },
   {
    "text": "答案就在你自己的电脑里，它有一台小冰箱。",
    "start": 4.381,
    "dur": 3.678
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:hook-2"
 },
 "first-1": {
  "start": 505,
  "duration": 329,
  "audioFrames": 269,
  "audioSec": 8.967,
  "chapter": "first",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第一次打开网页，浏览器要跑一趟店里，把图片、脚本、样式这些东西都买回来，可能还要经过上两期讲的门店和柜台。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.961
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:first-1",
  "origDuration": 277,
  "holdAt": 277,
  "extraHold": 52,
  "labelHold": 52
 },
 "first-2": {
  "start": 782,
  "duration": 356,
  "audioFrames": 346,
  "audioSec": 11.533,
  "chapter": "first",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 277,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "买回来以后，浏览器顺手放进冰箱存一份，这个冰箱就叫浏览器缓存。",
    "start": 0.008,
    "dur": 6.422
   },
   {
    "text": "它其实就是你电脑上的一块存储空间，专门放网页用过的东西。",
    "start": 6.71,
    "dur": 4.834
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:first-2"
 },
 "second-1": {
  "start": 1138,
  "duration": 295,
  "audioFrames": 287,
  "audioSec": 9.567,
  "chapter": "second",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第二次再打开，浏览器先看看冰箱：要的东西已经在里面，直接拿出来用，连门都不用出，也不用排队等柜台，所以快。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.564
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:second-1"
 },
 "second-2": {
  "start": 1433,
  "duration": 262,
  "audioFrames": 252,
  "audioSec": 8.4,
  "chapter": "second",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 295,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": false,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "注意分清楚：C D N 是离你近的门店，缓存是你家里的冰箱。",
    "start": 0.011,
    "dur": 5.462
   },
   {
    "text": "门店再近，也没有打开冰箱近。",
    "start": 5.752,
    "dur": 2.653
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:second-2"
 },
 "freshness-1": {
  "start": 1695,
  "duration": 428,
  "audioFrames": 394,
  "audioSec": 13.429,
  "chapter": "freshness",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": true,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "那冰箱里的东西能一直吃吗？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.749
   },
   {
    "text": "不行。",
    "start": 3.029,
    "dur": 0.702
   },
   {
    "text": "服务器通常会给东西贴一张保质期标签，这张标签叫 Cache-Control，里面的 max-age 写着能放多少秒。",
    "start": 4.011,
    "dur": 9.133,
    "revoiced": "freshness-1-s2-a"
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:freshness-1",
  "origDuration": 403,
  "holdAt": 403,
  "extraHold": 25,
  "labelHold": 25
 },
 "freshness-2": {
  "start": 2087,
  "duration": 450,
  "audioFrames": 440,
  "audioSec": 14.667,
  "chapter": "freshness",
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 392,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "model": "mimo-v2.5-tts",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "gap": 0.28,
  "scale": 1,
  "provisional": false,
  "revoiced": true,
  "holdFrames": 0,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "没过保质期，浏览器就放心直接用，这叫强缓存；过了保质期，就不能再直接拿了。",
    "start": -0.005,
    "dur": 7.24
   },
   {
    "text": "这张标签有长有短：常换的东西放得短，几乎不变的图标可以放很久。",
    "start": 7.515,
    "dur": 7.154
   }
  ],
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7v122-timing.json:freshness-2"
 },
